    <item>
      <title>WallX 0.0.4</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:25:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>WallX v0.0.4</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Now Playing</b> — see the current wallpaper's name + thumbnail at the top of the menu.</li>
          <li><b>Global keyboard shortcuts</b> — rebindable hotkeys for Start/Stop and Next Wallpaper.</li>
          <li><b>Drag &amp; drop</b> — drop a video onto the WallX menu-bar icon to set it.</li>
          <li>Multi-monitor rendering improvements (independent player per display).</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
